This function lists all the tools that a specific agent has access to.
The tools are defined in TOOLS_BY_TYPE in swarm/functions.py, keyed by agent type.
For now this is just the docker sandbox, granted to the coding, testing, optimization, and math agents that can run and test things in docker.
It is implemented as list_tools in swarm/functions.py and is reached through the >>LIST_TOOLS<< arrow.
